An expired enrollment code was presented for redemption. It was refused and no
certificate was issued.

Two things cause this, and they need opposite responses. Either a job you still
want is failing on schedule and needs re-enrolling, or a credential you thought
was gone is still in circulation. If the address below is not a host you
recognize, treat the code as leaked and audit what it was used for while it was
still live.

